Mimir the shopkeeper~
Mimir, bent and stooped with age and wisdom, carefully cleans his shelves.
~
   Stooped and bent with countless years of wisdom, Mimir is bound to eternally
serve Odin and the gods with sage advice and understanding. Though his head has
been restored to him, he still remains indentured to Odin and bound to offer
his wisdom and advice any time he requests it. Time has offered him the chance
to pursue an interest in the mixing and brewing of potions which offers to
Midgaards travelers and brave adventurers.
~
