Greater Earth Elemental~
A Greater Earth Elemental looms here, grinding like a landslide.
~
 This towering figure of fused rock and packed earth lumbers hunched
under its own weight, every step shedding gravel and dust. Veins of
glittering ore run through its boulder torso, and its heavy fists
