Greater Air Elemental~
A Greater Air Elemental swirls here in a column of howling wind.
~
 A spinning funnel of wind holds the vague outline of a tall, thin
figure, its stormy edges constantly shredding and re-forming. Hail
and bits of debris race around it as small arcs of static crackle
along its length. Where its eyes should be are two bright pinpricks
of white lightning, while faint glyphs of binding float within the
heart of the storm.
~
