elemental greater void~
Greater Void Elemental~
A Greater Void Elemental floats here, swallowing the light.
~
 This is less a creature than a black hole in the shape of one;
a tall shifting silhouette of absolute darkness whose umbral
edges trail like torn cloth. Light bends toward it and never
returns, while the air around it is eerily silent. Thin lines
of pale violet glyphs of binding hold the void's shape together,
flickering as it moves.
~
